# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# The 2023 site served the SAME 3KB file at every path, so any of these could have
# been shared, bookmarked or linked. Sending them to a 404 would turn one broken
# front door into six. Old paths go where their content actually lives now.
/about/        /answers/   301
/about         /answers/   301
/portfolio/    /work/      301
/portfolio     /work/      301
/contact/      /answers/   301
/contact       /answers/   301

